        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwalenga ikumi limo na shisano (15) mu mweshi walenga cine lubali, kukaleba ukulongana kwamushilo, kabili mwikabombamo imilimo ya cila bushiku. Mulesefya inshikunkulu pa nshiku cine lubali pakucindika Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli nokutuula Yawe ilambo lyakoca ilya cena icisuma icakumusekesha. Ilambo lya fiponti fya ŋombe ifilume ikumi limo na fitatu (13), basukusuku babili no twana twa mpaanga utulume ikumi limo na tune (14) utwa mwaka umo umo, fyonse ifyabula akalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali cila ŋombe ilume pa ŋombe ishilume ikumi limo na shitatu (13) mupekanishishepo utwapekumi tutatu twa ku cipimo ca efa wa bunga bwa ŋanu ubwapeleka bwino ubwasanshiwamo na mafuta ya miolifa. Pali basukusuku babili, mupekanishishepo cila umo utwapekumi tubili twa kuli efa wa bunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo pali cila kana ka mpaanga, pa twana twa mpaanga ikumi limo na tune (14), mupekanishishepo icipe cimo pekumi ica efa wa bunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubikepo na sawe umo ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa fyabubifi, ukulunda pelambo lyakoca ilyacila bushiku pamo pene no mutuulo wa cabunga no wa fyakunwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
