              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwalenga shibili, mupekanye ifiponti fya ŋombe ifilume ikumi limo na fibili (12), basukusuku babili no twana twa mpaanga utulume ikumi limo na tune (14) utwa mwaka umo umo, fyonse ifyabula ubulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ŋombe ishilume, basukusuku no twana twa mpaanga mupekanishishepo imituulo ya cabunga ne ya fyakunwa ukulingana ne mpendwa yapimwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
